ription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-17T19:42:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:19Z","closed_at":"2026-06-23T12:02:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.7.beta2, 4.7.rc2 and 4.7.rc3\nNot reproducible in: 4.6.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc3.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter testing out 4.7 I noticed that in my main scene, updating the scene tree hierarchy by moving or deleting nodes was taking a really long time to the point that the engine would freeze for upwards of 10-20 seconds:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e168b6d8-6ce6-4c93-b144-4ea0f9e543ce\n\nCompare this to renaming a node in the exact same scene on 4.6 stable:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c8d3a81-04a7-4c23-989e-3f03e8ece990\n\nAfter doing a process of elimination, when I removed all my NPCs from the scene and the player character the updating became near instantaneous again. After digging into my NPC scene and Player scene I discovered that when I removed the AnimationPlayer, the updates became near instantaneous.\n\nI have a pretty absurd amount of animations in my players because I'm using the UAL1+2 libraries:\n\n<img width=\"1282\" height=\"1187\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71eb658a-4c10-4ac4-8f40-2698aeb6c487\" />\n\nBut since this issue isn't happening in 4.6 I can only assume 4.7 made some changes that force the animation player to enumerate all of its animations whenever the scene tree is modified?\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a scene with lots of nodes that contain AnimationPlayers that contain many animations\n2. Make an edit to a node in the SceneTree\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nBorrowing the UAL Standard library that is free to download, I've created an MRP by using the UAL GLB as a scene and instantiating it 74 times which freezes the editor for around 7 seconds. It seems the issue scales up considerably the more animations present in a single player but in lieu of multiple animations I can get it reproduced by adding more nodes.\n\n[animplayer-freeze-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29065920/animplayer-freeze-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120379/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120379/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}